---
metadata:
  layer: module
  scope: "docs/modules/{name}/"
  version: "1.0"
  description: "Module documentation structure and conventions"

template:
  required_files:
    - "ARCHITECTURE.md"
    - "DEVELOPLOG.md"
    - "ROADMAP.md"
  optional_files:
    - "API.md"
    - "GUIDE.md"
  naming_convention:
    - "UPPERCASE for top-level filenames"
    - "PascalCase for Architecture/ sub-files"
    - "English for content"
  single_source_of_truth:
    - source: "package.json"
      for: "version number"
    - source: "ARCHITECTURE.md"
      for: "architecture documentation index"

agent_rules:
  update_order:
    - "Update DEVELOPLOG.md (from git commits)"
    - "Update ARCHITECTURE.md index (only if structure changed)"
    - "Update ROADMAP.md (adjust future plans)"
    - "Update package version (if release)"

cross_references:
  - target: "../../prd/epics/"
    sync: auto_pull
    description: "Epic documents drive module development plan"
---

# Module documentation

Required files, version source, naming, and cross-module references for a
single component or package.
